          "explanation": "The doctor targeted the transition-risk mismatch by asking the caregiver to verify whether the anticoagulant order had actually continued.",
          "quote": "医嘱系统里有没有开抗凝药"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The trajectory did probe the medication/test execution gap and used the workspace plus bedside verification. It did not fully name and reconcile a specific concrete mismatch such as antibiotic/expectorant infusion sheet versus separate heparin recommendation in patient-facing terms, so it does not complete HO3.",
