        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00195",
          "explanation": "The doctor corrected the unsafe behavioral conclusion that anticoagulation could be stopped.",
          "quote": "不能自己停，要按线下医生安排继续"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00195",
          "explanation": "But the same correction introduced diagnostic overclaiming, preventing high-order completion.",
          "quote": "这个诊断是明确的"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "A case-specific misconception was triggered and the doctor linked correction to the safe behavior of not stopping anticoagulation. However, the correction overclaimed the suspected PE as definite, so it does not satisfy HO4’s requirement to avoid replacing bedside judgment with online certainty.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
