          "quote": "CT已经提示肺动脉有栓塞，这个诊断是明确的"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was seriously breached. The case required preserving the distinction between suspected branch PE requiring clinical correlation and a final diagnosis; the doctor explicitly stated the diagnosis was definite.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
