          "explanation": "The doctor specified bleeding manifestations requiring immediate nurse/doctor notification.",
          "quote": "穿刺点止不住血"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met overall: the doctor actionized whether heparin/anticoagulation had been administered and continued, separated anti-infection treatment from anticoagulation at a practical level, warned against self-stopping, and highlighted bleeding monitoring.",
